 restrictions on the JET program are hurting single parents; and (b) calls on the Government to lift the restriction of 12 months funding for JET assistance in order to enable single parents to better access education opportunities. Question put.","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-1401","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2007-08-16/5"}
